<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps forms joint venture affiliate.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps forms joint venture affiliate.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Friday it established a new rating affiliation in Africa by forming a partnership with  Republic Ratings, which is based in Johannesburg, South Africa.</p>
<p>Republic Ratings, which is the largest rating agency in Africa, presently rates 160 organizations, including banks, insurance companies and large industrial borrowers, on a local currency basis.</p>
<p>Republic Ratings, which will be known as Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co of Southern Africa (Pty) Ltd, will rate both local and foreign currency debt obligations.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
